<title>SWITZERLAND: RESEARCH ALERT-UBS keeps hold for Zurich.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-UBS keeps hold for Zurich.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>UBS said it was maintaining its &quot;hold&quot; recommendation and earnings estimates for Zurich Group after the insurer announced plans to acquire U.S. asset manager Scudder, Stevens &amp; Clark.</p>
<p>&quot;In our view, the relatively expensive valuation of Zurich shares (P/E 97E of 21.0) discounts the strategic expansion of the asset management area,&quot; it said in a research note.</p>
<p>	     Net profit (mln Sfr)  EPS (Sfr)  P/E   Div (Sfr)</p>
<p> 1997	    1,340		   28.6     21.0    8.5</p>
<p> 1998	    1,540		   32.8     18.3    9.8</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
